OL,3,GNEWSAVillage's scarecrow festival makes
OL,4,Aa return
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 30 scarecrows have gone on
OL,7,Fdisplay in a Lincolnshire village over
OL,8,Fthe bank holiday weekend.
OL,10,FDonington on Bain's Scarecrow Festival,
OL,11,Fnear Louth, has featured a trail of
OL,12,Fcreative displays inspired by
OL,13,Fsuperheroes, spiders, bears and
OL,14,FVikings.
OL,16,FFestival organiser Karl Kay said:
OL,17,F"[I'm] really pleased with the response
OL,18,Fwe're getting from people on social
OL,19,Fmedia and people wandering around the
OL,20,Fvillage."
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
